# Runtime state, renders, models, logs, databases — never source
data/runtime/
# The package's own data/runtime/ holds hand-maintained config (tracked) next to generated
# indices and per-run state (not source). Only the generated ones are listed here; the
# tracked indices are keyed to the roots in zyg_workflows.paths, not to absolute paths.
src/zyg_workflows/data/runtime/asset_library_instruments_meta.json*
src/zyg_workflows/data/runtime/asset_library_vfx_meta.json*
